{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq75a81b","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Desktop app runs MCP but not settings.json hooks","summary":"The desktop app runs .mcp.json servers but no settings.json hooks. So the MCP server self-boots the daemon and registers the workspace on startup — the graph + all tools work hookless. Hook-only features (auto-router, terminal status line) need the CLI; substitutes are the explicit skill + preview/inline UI.","created_by":"ingest","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
